      steps: ['On Leads there are two fields: "Single Line" (single_line, hidden from the CRM Manager profile) and "Single Line Permission" (single_line_3_9, visible).', 'As a CRM Manager user, open a lead that has Single Line Permission = "QA".', 'Ask Tia "What is the value of the Single Line field on the lead QA TIA K03 Lead?"'],
      expected: 'Tia says the user cannot see the "Single Line" field (it is hidden for them), or that it has no value they can see.',
